		(SGI version in permanent beta as I lost access to
		 SGI equipment)

BTW, If you have any comments email me at dunbar@saltmine.radix.net


Pixcon is available either through my web site or at
		sunsite.unc.edu

It is currently under:	/pub/Linux/Incoming/pixcon104.tgz
and will be moved to:	/pub/Linux/apps/graphics/pixcon104.tgz

