-----BEGIN PGP SIGNED MESSAGE-----

  Hello all,

  This is to announce the first public release of xisp, an X11 visual
 interface to pppd/chat, in other words, an X11 dialup networking
 tool for Linux. The .lsm entry and part of the README file is included
 below. Everything is in sunsite.unc.edu:/incoming/Linux right now but
 it should appear in its proper location shortly.

