CREDITS:
	Jan Hubicka	(hubicka@paru.cas.cz) 
	                - Zooming routines, ugly interface,
			  palettes,drivers, autopilot, stereograms,
			  fast julia browsing mode
	Thomas Marsh	(tmarsh@austin.ibm.com)
