Announcements:

  The Software Library of old is no more.  All of the software
  that was loaned out was never returned.  We are instituting a
  new policy where all loans will be recorded.  Software should
  be returned by the next meeting, although arrangements can be
  made to keep the software for longer periods.  The software
  library will be restocked with new items as they are donated
  by both members and local sponsors.  We believe we may be able
  to retrieve at least some of the old items as well.

  Information on the new policy will be available at the next
  meeting and at every meeting afterwards.

