   center on the left, and a Stoplight. Take a left on Quincy. Then the 
   first stoplight with a right turn will be Smoky Hill Road.  Turn
   right onto Smoky Hill, cross Chambers (a light), and then turn right 
   at Laredo (a stop light), then left into the School parking lot. Go 
   past the main entrance, and to the activities entrance.  There will 
   be signs posted in the building to direct you to the room where we meet.

