Date: 1997/02/24
Message-ID: <pgpmoose.199702240800.8611@liw.clinet.fi>
X-Deja-AN: 221000481
X-Original-Date: 20 Feb 1997 21:39:52 -0800
X-Server-Date: 24 Feb 1997 06:00:59 GMT
Followup-To: comp.os.linux.misc
